        "text": "API endpoints (via proxy at /):<br>• GET /health — status check<br>• GET /ui — browser UI<br>• POST /v1/parse — extract RFP text<br>• POST /v1/parse/file — upload RFP file<br>• POST /v1/fee/calculate — compute fees<br>• POST /v1/proposals/generate — generate proposal<br>• GET /v1/proposals/{id} — retrieve proposal<br>• PUT /v1/proposals/{id} — update proposal",
        "fill": "gray",
        "_order": "a0020"
      },
      "width": 420
    },
    "tSections": {
      "type": "sticky",
      "id": "tSections",
